{"lemma":"גָּרַע","translit":"gâraʻ","pronunciation":"gaw-rah'","def":"to scrape off; by implication, to shave, remove, lessen, withhold","kjv":"abate, clip, (di-) minish, do (take) away, keep back, restrain, make small, withdraw.","occ":[[17,36,27,"For he maketh small"],[17,36,7,"He withdraweth"],[25,16,27,"over thee, and have diminished"],[17,15,4,"and restrainest"],[3,27,4,"be done away"],[4,4,2,"you, neither shall ye diminish"],[23,48,37,"clipped"],[17,15,8,"and dost thou restrain"],[4,12,32,"thereto, nor diminish"],[1,21,10,"shall he not diminish"],[1,5,8,"upon them; ye shall not diminish"],[20,3,14,"to it, nor any thing taken"],[1,5,19,"Ye shall not minish"],[3,9,7,"wherefore are we kept back"],[3,36,3,"be taken"],[1,5,11,"shall be diminished"],[25,5,11,"therefore will I also diminish"],[3,36,4,"be taken away"],[2,27,18,"and it shall be abated"],[3,36,3,"whereunto they are received: so shall it be taken"],[23,26,2,"unto them; diminish"]]}